body:
Hey everyone! :wave: Please join me in welcoming *{{first_name}} {{last_name}}* to the {{department}} team! {{first_name}} is joining us as a *{{job_title}}* starting {{start_date}}.

{{first_name}}, a little about your new team: {{team_description}}

Your onboarding buddy is {{buddy_name}} -- feel free to reach out to them with any questions. We're so glad to have you on board! :tada:

Dear {{recipient_name}},

This is a reminder that the following onboarding tasks for {{first_name}} {{last_name}} ({{job_title}}, {{department}}) are due by {{due_date}}:

{{task_list}}

New hire start date: {{start_date}}
Days remaining: {{days_remaining}}

Please complete these tasks as soon as possible to ensure a smooth onboarding experience. You can track progress in the onboarding dashboard at {{dashboard_url}}.

If you have any questions or need assistance, contact {{hr_contact_name}} at {{hr_contact_email}}.

Thank you,
HR Onboarding System

Dear {{recipient_name}},

This is a reminder that the following offboarding tasks for {{first_name}} {{last_name}} ({{job_title}}, {{department}}) must be completed by {{due_date}}:

{{task_list}}

Last working day: {{last_day}}
Days remaining: {{days_remaining}}

Timely completion of these tasks is critical for security compliance and a smooth transition. Track progress at {{dashboard_url}}.

If you have any questions, contact {{hr_contact_name}} at {{hr_contact_email}}.

Thank you,
HR Offboarding System

Dear {{first_name}} {{last_name}},

The following IT asset has been assigned to you:

Asset ID: {{asset_id}}
Type: {{asset_type}}
Brand/Model: {{asset_brand}} {{asset_model}}
Specs: {{asset_specs}}
Serial Number: {{serial_number}}

Assignment Date: {{assignment_date}}
Pickup Location: {{pickup_location}}

Please review and acknowledge the IT Asset Usage Policy at {{policy_url}}. By accepting this asset, you agree to the terms outlined in the policy.

If you experience any issues with your equipment, please submit a ticket at {{support_url}} or contact IT Support at {{it_support_email}}.

Best regards,
{{it_admin_name}}
IT Department

Dear {{first_name}} {{last_name}},

You have been granted the following access role:

Role: {{role_name}}
Role ID: {{role_id}}
Description: {{role_description}}
Granted By: {{granted_by}}
Effective Date: {{effective_date}}

Permissions included:
{{permissions_list}}

Please review the access policies and acceptable use guidelines at {{policy_url}}. If you believe you have been granted access in error, or if you need additional permissions, please contact your manager or the Security team at {{security_email}}.

This access will be reviewed periodically as part of our security compliance program.

Best regards,
Access Management System
{{company_name}}

Dear {{first_name}} {{last_name}},

Welcome to {{company_name}}! You are invited to attend the New Hire Orientation session:

Date: {{orientation_date}}
Time: {{orientation_time}}
Location: {{orientation_location}}
Duration: {{orientation_duration}}

Agenda:
{{agenda}}

Please bring:
- Government-issued photo ID
- Completed tax forms (W-4 and state equivalent)
- Voided check or bank details for direct deposit setup

Lunch will be provided. If you have dietary restrictions, please reply to this email.

Calendar invite: {{calendar_link}}

If you have any questions, contact {{hr_contact_name}} at {{hr_contact_email}}.

See you there!

Best regards,
{{hr_sender_name}}
Human Resources

Dear {{first_name}} {{last_name}},

As part of our offboarding process, we would like to invite you to an exit interview:

Date: {{interview_date}}
Time: {{interview_time}}
Location: {{interview_location}}
Interviewer: {{interviewer_name}}
Duration: Approximately {{interview_duration}}

The exit interview is an opportunity for you to share your experiences, feedback, and suggestions. Your input is valuable and helps us improve as an organization. All responses will be kept confidential.

Topics we may discuss:
- Your overall experience at {{company_name}}
- Team dynamics and management
- Career development opportunities
- Suggestions for improvement

If the scheduled time does not work, please reply to reschedule.

Calendar invite: {{calendar_link}}

Thank you,
{{hr_sender_name}}
Human Resources

Dear {{manager_name}},

This is to confirm that {{first_name}} {{last_name}} will be joining your team in the {{department}} department.

New Hire Details:
- Name: {{first_name}} {{last_name}}
- Job Title: {{job_title}}
- Level: {{level}}
- Start Date: {{start_date}}
- Office Location: {{office_location}}
- Employee ID: {{employee_id}}

As their manager, please complete the following before their start date:

1. Prepare a 30-60-90 day plan
2. Identify and confirm an onboarding buddy (suggested: {{suggested_buddy}})
3. Schedule a welcome 1:1 for their first day
4. Review and approve their access role requests
5. Ensure their workspace/desk is set up
6. Add them to relevant team meetings and channels

Onboarding dashboard: {{dashboard_url}}

Please reach out to {{hr_contact_name}} ({{hr_contact_email}}) if you have any questions.

Best regards,
HR Onboarding Team
